{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\ls128\tx760\fi-400\sb120\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li760\lin760\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\listtext
\pard\plain\tx760\fi-400\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li760\lin760\ri0\rin0\ql\faauto\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\cf2 \u8226 \tab }{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 On April 4, 2025, Freedom Mobile Inc. (\u8220 Freedom\u8221 ) began the phased rollout of 3800 MHz spectrum across its 5G+ network in Ontario, Alberta and British Columbia. This rollout will significantly increase network capacity and deliver improved connectivity for customers with 5G+ compatible devices and plans, with download speeds that can exceed 1 Gbps. It follows on the announcement, on January 28, 2025, of a major upgrade to Freedom\u8217 s services: the inclusion of state-of-the-art 5G+ technology in all monthly mobile plans, regardless of price. 5G+ access was also automatically added to the 5G plans of all existing customers with compatible phones, at no extra cost.  }
{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\ls129\tx760\fi-400\sb120\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li760\lin760\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\listtext
\pard\plain\tx760\fi-400\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li760\lin760\ri0\rin0\ql\faauto\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\cf2 \u8226 \tab }{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 On February 20, 2025, Videotron Ltd. (\u8220 Videotron\u8221 ) announced the expansion of its wireless service area to several parts of the Municipalit\'e9 r\'e9gionale de comt\'e9 (\u8220 MRC\u8221 ) de T\'e9miscamingue. Residents and businesses in these areas can now subscribe to Videotron wireless services.  }
{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\ls130\tx760\fi-400\sb120\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li760\lin760\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\listtext
\pard\plain\tx760\fi-400\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li760\lin760\ri0\rin0\ql\faauto\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\cf2 \u8226 \tab }{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 On February 5, 2025, Fizz announced the launch of Fizz TV, an all-digital television service. Available to all Fizz Internet subscribers in Qu\'e9bec, Fizz TV is differentiated by a pick-and-pay model that lets users build their own TV plan.  }
{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24
\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Comments by Pierre Karl P\'e9ladeau, President and Chief Executive Officer of Quebecor}{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard
\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2
\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Quebecor continues to perform well in a highly competitive market, disrupting the established order and reshaping the industry as Canada\u8217 s fourth major telecommunications player. The Corporation continues to make progress, gaining market share quarter after quarter while consolidating its position as the most profitable player in the sector, supported by the strongest balance sheet in the Canadian telecommunications industry.}
{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24
\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Pierre Karl P\'e9ladeau, President and Chief Executive Officer of Quebecor}{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0
\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Quebecor posted solid financial results in the first quarter of 2025, including increases of 8.1% in cash flows provided by operating activities and 13.5% in adjusted income from operating activities. As a result of this strong performance, driven by rigorous disciplined management, we were able to reduce our consolidated net debt by more than $155.0 million in the first quarter of 2025 and lower our consolidated net debt leverage ratio to 3.26x at March 31, 2025, the lowest among Canada\u8217 s major telecommunications providers.}
{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24
\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 In an aggressively competitive business environment, our innovative range of products offered at competitive prices allowed us to deliver an increase of 54,400 (1.3%) new mobile lines in the first quarter of 2025, the best growth rate among Canada\u8217 s leading telecommunications providers, and 367,500 (9.6%) lines over the past twelve months. We continued investing in our network, in line with our priority of delivering a superior customer experience. Since April 2025, we have been gradually deploying 3800 MHz spectrum across Freedom\u8217 s 5G+ network in Ontario, Alberta and British Columbia. With access to state-of-the-art 5G+ technology now included in all Freedom monthly mobile plans, regardless of price, this rollout will significantly boost network capacity and performance. In February 2025, Freedom also launched a new range of mobile plans in Manitoba that offer higher data caps and include \u8220 Roam Beyond\u8221  international roaming.}
{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24
\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Freedom brand awareness is also growing. Freedom is an official sponsor of the 2025 Calgary Stampede, one of Canada\u8217 s most iconic cultural events; the exceptional exposure to millions of attendees and television viewers will strengthen its national positioning.}
{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24
\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 We are also proud of the resounding success of Fizz TV, the all-digital television service we launched in February 2025. Available to Fizz Internet subscribers in Qu\'e9bec, Fizz TV meets the needs of customers seeking flexibility, accessibility and innovation. More than 12,000 new customers signed up in just a few weeks, confirming the relevance of our offer and the appeal of the Fizz brand in a fast-changing market.}
{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24
\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Videotron continued to pick up distinctions, ranking as the most respected telecommunications company in Qu\'e9bec for the 19th time since 2006 in L\'e9ger\u8217 s 2025 Reputation survey. It also hit a double in L\'e9ger\u8217 s WOW 2025 index, in which it ranked first among telecom retailers for in-store experience in Qu\'e9bec while Fizz was first in Canada for online experience for the sixth year in a row. Freedom moved up to third place for online experience.}
{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24
\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Although its current restructuring plans have reduced operating expenses considerably, TVA Group Inc. (\u8220 TVA Group\u8221 ) recorded negative adjusted EBITDA of $20.5 million in the first quarter of 2025 as a result of a significant ongoing decline in advertising revenues due to the general crisis in the media industry and fewer major foreign productions filming at our MELS studios. We must therefore maintain a rigorous approach in order to meet the current challenges and safeguard the future of the business.}
{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24
\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Even though TVA Group gained market share, climbing to a total of 42.4% in the Winter 2025 season (January 6 to April 6, 2025), our advertising revenues continued to decline. Our platforms deliver considerably more viewing hours than the American platforms, but advertisers continue to pour their dollars into the latter. Yet their reliability pales in comparison with the credibility of local media, which offer advertisers an unrivalled showcase and reach their target audiences more effectively. As we have repeatedly argued, we believe that the federal government must eliminate the tax deduction for advertising spending on foreign platforms and, conversely, introduce a tax deduction for investment in domestic businesses. At a time when the proliferation of fake news on social media is widely condemned, it defies logic that our public institutions continue to encourage foreign platforms and our governments support them through unfair favourable tax treatment.}
{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24
\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Moreover, as private broadcasters struggle to survive in an over-regulated, over-taxed and loss-making broadcasting environment with a long-obsolete business model, the federal government must move quickly to implement the recommendations of the 2020 Yale Report by reforming CBC/Radio-Canada and its mandate, in particular by eliminating advertising in order to support private broadcasters, for which it is the main source of revenue.}
{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24
\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 I would like to mention the upcoming retirement, on May 14, of Lyne Robitaille, Senior Vice President, Newspapers, Books and Magazines, and a valued contributor for the past 36 years. Lyne has had a remarkable career. Over the years, she has led the development and growth of several Quebecor subsidiaries. She oversaw a number of major transformations at Quebecor, including the digital transition of our newspapers, which made Le Journal de Montr\'e9al and Le Journal de Qu\'e9bec the most-read newspapers in Qu\'e9bec across all platforms, with over 3.1 million readers per week. On behalf of Quebecor, I wish her all the best in her well-deserved retirement.}
{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24
\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 In April 2025, on the occasion of the 100th anniversary of the birth of Pierre P\'e9ladeau, Quebecor launched a year-long tribute to honour the memory of its founder, a visionary builder of Qu\'e9bec Inc. who helped transform and modernize Qu\'e9bec society and its economy. This anniversary is also a reminder that the philanthropic commitment that was so important to Pierre P\'e9ladeau remains central to Quebecor\u8217 s values, as our recent historic donations\u8212 $20 million to Universit\'e9 Laval to support the Carrefour international Brian-Mulroney and $10 million to the Fondation du CHU de Qu\'e9bec to support its integrated cancer centre\u8212 eloquently demonstrate. Several other events will follow in the course of the year.}
{\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\af2\afs24\ltrch\fs20\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24
\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Today, the innovation, ambition and courage to think big that we inherited from Pierre P\'e9ladeau continue to drive our growth and expansion. Extending our track record of successful execution, we are maintaining rigorous financial discipline and building on solid foundations to achieve our objectives and create long-term value for all our stakeholders.}
